{"world_id":"wld_aetheria","title":"The Emberroost Accord","logline":"As the skybridges of Aetheria begin to fail, a stubborn cartographer and a ruthless toll-master must decide whether the Bridge Wardens, Drift Cartel, and Hollow Circle can forge a truce at Emberroost before the network collapses and strands every isle.","theme":"Shared truths hold what hoarded power cannot","acts":[{"id":"act_setup","title":"Fraying Bridges","purpose":"setup","scenes":[{"id":"scn_charting_the_breaks","title":"Charting the Breaks","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya uses her wind-sight to read the currents and finds that the main skybridge routes are failing faster than anyone has admitted. Her late mentor's theory that the isles are drifting apart begins to look true.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Chart a safe route through the breaking skybridge network and confirm her mentor's theory.","conflict":"The data points to a collapse sooner than predicted, and Veya's stubborn pride makes her reluctant to share unfinished work that might prove her wrong.","outcome":"Veya completes a draft chart showing which bridges will fail and which routes remain stable, and she resolves to keep it close until it is perfect."},{"id":"scn_kael_hears_of_the_charts","title":"The Price of a Map","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael learns that Veya has charted the last stable routes. He sees that whoever controls those charts controls trade, and he moves to secure them before the bridges collapse.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Seize the last stable skybridge routes by getting hold of Veya's charts.","conflict":"Kael admires Veya's skill but cannot let her succeed on her own terms. He also has to push the Cartel's toll-masters to act while the Wardens accuse him of sabotaging forge-island supplies.","outcome":"Kael sends a Cartel summons to Veya, offering to buy her charts. Behind it he plans to bury them if she refuses.","depends_on":["scn_charting_the_breaks"]},{"id":"scn_levy_squeeze_at_the_hollow","title":"The Levy Squeeze","summary":"In The Hollow, Maris watches Cartel enforcers tighten the grain levy and close in on her smuggling routes. She decides to move grain through the unmapped service corridors her isle depends on.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris"],"goal":"Smuggle enough grain to keep The Hollow fed through the crisis.","conflict":"Cartel enforcers are closing in, and Maris trusts slowly. She must decide whether to seek outside help or rely only on her own people.","outcome":"Maris slips one shipment past the enforcers but is nearly caught. She realises she needs a safe route that no Cartel patrol knows.","depends_on":["scn_kael_hears_of_the_charts"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Tolls and Fires","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_veya_meets_maris","title":"Paths for Currents","summary":"Veya, wary of the Cartel summons, travels to The Hollow. She and Maris strike a bargain: Veya's wind-current knowledge for Maris's secret service corridors.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants a hidden route to travel unobserved; Maris wants a way to keep her smuggling lanes safe from the Cartel.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and Veya will not hand over her unfinished chart. Each fears the other will use the exchange to gain control.","outcome":"They agree to trade knowledge. Maris guides Veya along the corridors, and a fragile alliance forms.","depends_on":["scn_levy_squeeze_at_the_hollow","scn_kael_hears_of_the_charts"]},{"id":"scn_forge_pit_sabotage","title":"Sparks at the Forge-Pit","summary":"At Emberroost, the Bridge Wardens find a cable damaged near a shielded forge-pit. The open-flame ban means a single spark could sever a skybridge. The Wardens accuse the Cartel of sabotage, and Veya arrives to read the stress in the cloudstone.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to assess the damage and prove the bridges are failing naturally; Maris wants to avoid being blamed for the Hollow's smuggling.","conflict":"The Wardens suspect Cartel sabotage and Veya's reading is not yet certain. She will not admit uncertainty, and the dispute raises tension among the factions.","outcome":"Veya's reading shows the cable failed through strain, not sabotage. The Wardens, still angry at the Cartel, call for a council at Emberroost.","depends_on":["scn_veya_meets_maris"]},{"id":"scn_kael_confronts_veya","title":"Kael Names His Price","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael confronts Veya with a Cartel offer. He will protect her charts and grant her safe passage if she hands them over, or the Cartel will seize them. Maris's smuggling is used as leverage.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Kael wants the charts to secure Cartel control of the stable routes; Veya wants to leave with her work and her friend intact.","conflict":"Kael's charm hides a threat, and he equates price with worth. Veya's refusal to admit her error in dealing with him leaves them exposed to his ledger-mastery.","outcome":"Veya and Maris escape with the charts after Maris leads them through a dock service corridor. Kael realises the three factions could unite against him, and Veya sees that the Cartel will not stop.","depends_on":["scn_forge_pit_sabotage"]},{"id":"scn_wardens_demand_council","title":"The Wardens' Ultimatum","summary":"Back at Silverspine, Veya argues with her own Wardens, who want to bury the Cartel and withhold the charts as a weapon. She is tempted to hoard the charts as Kael would, and Maris urges her to share them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the Wardens' backing without surrendering control of her charts; Maris wants a truce that ends the grain levy.","conflict":"Veya fears becoming like the ambitious cartel leaders, yet cannot admit her hoarding is the same instinct. Maris's loyalty to The Hollow strains against her friendship with Veya.","outcome":"Veya agrees to carry the charts to a three-faction council at Emberroost. The Wardens reluctantly agree to a truce meeting.","depends_on":["scn_kael_confronts_veya"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Emberroost Accord","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_council_at_emberroost","title":"The Council Convenes","summary":"The Bridge Wardens, Drift Cartel, and Hollow Circle gather at Emberroost. Kael argues for Cartel control of the routes, and Veya's charts show that no faction can hold the network alone.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the three factions to agree to a shared truce; Kael wants the Cartel to hold the last stable routes.","conflict":"Kael uses ledger-mastery to find the weak points in every arrangement, and Veya's pride tempts her to dismiss his counter-arguments instead of admitting her chart has errors.","outcome":"Kael exposes an error in Veya's chart, which she grudgingly admits. The council nearly collapses and a bridge cable groans under the strain.","depends_on":["scn_wardens_demand_council"]},{"id":"scn_the_accord_forged","title":"The Accord Is Forged","summary":"With a cable failing, Veya shares her corrected charts openly, Maris guides the factions along her service corridors, and Kael sees that control costs more than it gains. The three factions sign the Emberroost Accord, which shares the stable routes, caps tolls, and eases the grain levy.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Secure a truce that keeps the skybridges standing before they fail.","conflict":"Kael must give up the monopoly he has fought for, and Veya must share the work she wanted recognition for. Wind-debt and the ban on open flame mean the repair must be done carefully in the forge-pit.","outcome":"The factions sign the Accord and the Wardens, Cartel, and Hollow Circle begin repairs, with wind-debts repaid in labour.","depends_on":["scn_council_at_emberroost"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Bridges Mended","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kael_pays_the_price","title":"Kael's Reckoning","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael faces the Cartel's toll-masters, who object to the Accord. He chooses to honour it, and in doing so loses part of his old power while gaining a more durable position.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Persuade the Cartel to honour the Accord despite lost monopoly profits.","conflict":"Kael's belief that price equals worth makes him doubt the value of shared stability, and his rivals call him weak.","outcome":"The Cartel grudgingly accepts the Accord and Kael accepts a lesser role, understanding that control costs more than it gains.","depends_on":["scn_the_accord_forged"]},{"id":"scn_the_hollow_fed","title":"Grain Without Smuggling","summary":"In The Hollow, Maris sees the first legal grain shipments pass under the eased levy. Her secret corridors are no longer needed for smuggling, and she accepts that hiding can be as brave as standing still.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Confirm that The Hollow will be fed under the Accord.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and rarely forgives, so she must decide whether to trust the Cartel's promises and keep her friendship with Veya.","outcome":"Maris trusts the new arrangement and keeps her corridors in reserve. Her friendship with Veya is secure.","depends_on":["scn_the_accord_forged","scn_kael_pays_the_price"]},{"id":"scn_charts_shared","title":"Charts for Every Isle","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya copies her corrected charts for every faction. She accepts her mentor's theory in a form she can share, and she understands that some truths are safer shared than hoarded.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Distribute the charts so every isle can navigate the breaking network.","conflict":"Veya wants the credit for her mentor's theory, yet sharing the charts means giving up control of them. Kael arrives to offer the Cartel's help with distribution.","outcome":"Veya shares the charts openly, and Kael's rival-turned-partner helps carry them across the archipelago. The skybridges hold for another season.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollow_fed"]}]}]}
