e","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Distribute the charts so every isle can navigate the breaking network.","conflict":"Veya wants the credit for her mentor's theory, yet sharing the charts means giving up control of them. Kael arrives to offer the Cartel's help with distribution.","outcome":"Veya shares the charts openly, and Kael's rival-turned-partner helps carry them across the archipelago. The skybridges hold for another season.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollow_fed"]}]}]}
