 factions sign the Accord and the Wardens, Cartel, and Hollow Circle begin repairs, with wind-debts repaid in labour.","depends_on":["scn_council_at_emberroost"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Bridges Mended","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_kael_pays_the_price","title":"Kael's Reckoning","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael faces the Cartel's toll-masters, who object to the Accord. He chooses to honour it, and in doing so loses part of his old power while gaining a more durable position.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Persuade the Cartel to honour the Accord despite lost monopoly profits.","conflict":"Kael's belief that price equals worth makes him doubt the value of shared stability, and his rivals call him weak.","outcome":"The Cartel grudgingly accepts the Accord and Kael accepts a lesser role, understanding that control costs more than it gains.","depends_on":["scn_the_accord_forged"]},{"id":"scn_the_hollow_fed","title":"Grain Without Smuggling","summary":"In The Hollow, Maris sees the first legal grain shipments pass under the eased levy. Her secret corridors are no longer needed for smuggling, and she accepts that hiding can be as brave as standing still.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Confirm that The Hollow will be fed under the Accord.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and rarely forgives, so she must decide whether to trust the Cartel's promises and keep her friendship with Veya.","outcome":"Maris trusts the new arrangement and keeps her corridors in reserve. Her friendship with Veya is secure.","depends_on":["scn_the_accord_forged","scn_kael_pays_the_price"]},{"id":"scn_charts_shared","title":"Charts for Every Isle","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya copies her corrected charts for every faction. She accepts her mentor's theory in a form she can share, and she understands that some truths are safer shared than hoarded.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Distribute the charts so every isle can navigate the breaking network.","conflict":"Veya wants the credit for her mentor's theory, yet sharing the charts means giving up control of them. Kael arrives to offer the Cartel's help with distribution.","outcome":"Veya shares the charts openly, and Kael's rival-turned-partner helps carry them across the archipelago. The skybridges hold for another season.","depends_on":["scn_the_hollow_fed"]}]}]}
