as the evidence says otherwise, and Maris's reluctance to forgive makes the quarrel worse.","outcome":"The crossing fails and the two are stranded on The Hollow, forcing Veya to face that her map has a flaw she cannot fix alone.","depends_on":["scn_meeting_maris"]},{"id":"scn_emberroost_wardens","title":"Cloudstone and Warnings","summary":"Veya and Maris reach Emberroost by a corridor Maris knows. The Bridge Wardens tell them their supplies are being sabotaged. Veya sees that her chart could help the Wardens reinforce key bridges, but sharing it would end her sole claim to the discovery.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Persuade the Wardens to repair the failing routes and learn who is sabotaging them.","conflict":"Veya fears losing recognition, and the Wardens will not act on a chart she will not fully show.","outcome":"Veya shows the Wardens only part of the chart, and they find a pattern that points to Cartel interference.","depends_on":["scn_bridge_failure"]},{"id":"scn_kael_pressure","title":"The Grain Levy Tightens","summary":"Kael learns where Veya went and has enforcers close in on Maris's smuggling routes to force Veya out. Maris is caught between loyalty to her isle and her friendship with Veya, and Veya realises her secrecy has put her friend in danger.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to seize the stable routes through pressure on Maris. Maris wants to keep The Hollow fed.","conflict":"Kael's charm and pragmatism turn into threats, and Maris must decide whether to hide Veya or give her up.","outcome":"Maris chooses to stand with Veya, Kael takes the grain shipments, and Veya admits to herself that hoarding her chart is costing others.","depends_on":["scn_emberroost_wardens"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_confession","title":"Admitting the Error","summary":"Back at Silverspine, Veya finally admits the flaw in her chart. With Maris's corridors and the Wardens' findings, she corrects it and decides to copy the map for everyone rather than keep it secret.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Correct the chart and prepare to share it widely.","conflict":"Her pride and her fear of looking like the cartel leaders fight against her desire for recognition.","outcome":"The corrected chart is ready for copying, and Veya commits to a public reveal, which the Cartel will try to stop.","depends_on":["scn_kael_pressure"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Shared Map","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_docks_confrontation","title":"Charts at the Mistral Docks","summary":"Veya and Maris bring copies of the map to Mistral Docks, where captains and merchants gather. Kael tries to seize the charts and stop their distribution, but Veya hands them out openly. A bridge begins to fail and her wind-sight, combined with Maris's pathfinding, guides ships to safety.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to share the map with everyone. Kael wants to bury it and secure the routes for the Cartel.","conflict":"Kael's ledger-mastery lets him pressure the captains with debt and tolls, and Veya's pride tempts her to claim all the credit.","outcome":"The map is shared and the captains cross safely, so Kael's monopoly can no longer rest on controlling the charts.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_confession"]},{"id":"scn_kael_turns","title":"The Cost of Control","summary":"As the crowd uses the map, Kael sees that hoarding the routes would have left ships stranded. Veya offers him a place in sharing the map and trading under fair terms, and he accepts, letting go of his hold on the lanes.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to keep some control. Veya wants to end the standoff without destroying him.","conflict":"Kael equates price with worth, and Veya must not let her old rivalry turn into revenge.","outcome":"Kael releases the Cartel's hold on the stable routes, and the toll war begins to ease.","depends_on":["scn_docks_confrontation"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Charted Together","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_wardens_repair","title":"Braiding New Bridges","summary":"At Emberroost, the Wardens use the shared map to braid reinforcements for the weakest bridges, with Kael's cartel funding the cloudstone. Veya works alongside them and credits Maris and the Wardens openly.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Reinforce the failing bridges using the shared map.","conflict":"Old suspicions between the Wardens and the Cartel threaten to stall the work, and Kael must prove he is sincere.","outcome":"Repairs begin, the Wardens and Kael reach a cautious truce, and Kael's change is shown through action.","depends_on":["scn_kael_turns"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_return","title":"A Map for Home","summary":"Veya visits The Hollow to give Maris the first copy of the final map. With the grain levy eased, Maris sees that her hidden paths helped by being shared, and she forgives Veya. They add a new route together.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Mend their friendship and secure The Hollow's grain routes.","conflict":"Maris's slow trust and Veya's past stubbornness make the reconciliation awkward.","outcome":"Maris forgives Veya, The Hollow's routes are safe, and the two chart a new path together.","depends_on":["scn_wardens_repair"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_legacy","title":"Her Mentor's Theory, Shared","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya presents the map and her mentor's theory to the scholars as a joint work, naming everyone who contributed. Her recognition comes from the community's trust, not from hoarding.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris","chr_kael"],"goal":"Honour her mentor's theory and give shared credit for the map.","conflict":"Veya's old craving for sole recognition tempts her one last time.","outcome":"She shares the credit, the map becomes the archipelago's common chart, and she has learned that shared truths are safer.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_return"]}]}]}
